WEBVTT

00:02.980 --> 00:04.230
HIRONO-KUN

00:17.870 --> 00:19.780
Deleted

00:51.190 --> 00:52.110
Onii-chan...

00:57.780 --> 01:00.450
Hirono-kun, you aren't here?

01:04.660 --> 01:05.910
Hirono-kun...

01:05.910 --> 01:09.580
Oh, Miyamura-senpai. What can I do for you?

01:09.580 --> 01:11.380
"Wh-What"...?

01:11.380 --> 01:12.460
Where's Hirono-kun?

01:12.460 --> 01:14.710
Onii-chan is sleeping right now.

01:15.340 --> 01:17.220
Can you be quiet?

01:17.220 --> 01:20.260
Let me see him! I have something important to tell him.

01:20.260 --> 01:21.970
Let me see Hirono-kun!

01:21.970 --> 01:24.430
It will no longer reach him.

01:25.430 --> 01:27.190
I won't let it reach him.

01:27.190 --> 01:29.980
Because I'm always by Onii-chan's side.

01:30.980 --> 01:32.690
It's already over.

01:40.660 --> 01:43.490
Fly high, make it

01:43.490 --> 01:46.750
Get to the new world that I seek

01:47.000 --> 01:53.250
Someday with my little wings

01:53.420 --> 01:59.550
Don't look back to the sorrow I left behind

01:59.800 --> 02:05.770
Here's my real intention I hide

02:06.350 --> 02:12.480
I wish you were here, and so just right by my side

02:12.770 --> 02:18.860
Need to be strong enough to swallow my pride

02:19.070 --> 02:24.780
I have been looking for my own style

02:24.780 --> 02:32.290
Don't give it up, here comes the life

02:35.170 --> 02:37.920
Be alive, take it

02:37.920 --> 02:41.180
Promise to find, yes I will

02:41.470 --> 02:47.640
Shining wings filled with wishes

02:47.970 --> 02:50.730
Fly high, make it

02:50.730 --> 02:54.190
Get to the new world that I seek

02:54.230 --> 03:00.700
Someday, so I believe

03:23.010 --> 03:24.970
Good afternoon, Renji-kun.

03:24.970 --> 03:28.180
A-Ah, good afternoon.

03:29.310 --> 03:31.850
What's in the obento today?

03:32.480 --> 03:33.980
I'm hungry.

03:41.740 --> 03:46.410
It's delicious. I always look forward to your obento.

03:46.410 --> 03:48.410
How many points does it get today?

03:48.410 --> 03:52.330
It's so delicious that it can't be scored with points.

03:52.830 --> 03:54.330
R-Really?

03:54.330 --> 03:57.750
Please teach me how to cook next time.

03:57.750 --> 03:59.250
Teach you?

03:59.250 --> 04:03.010
My sister is practicing her cooking right now.

04:03.010 --> 04:05.930
I want to be able to cook something too.

04:05.930 --> 04:10.060
I see. Let's try something simple then.

04:10.060 --> 04:10.890
Okay.

04:15.900 --> 04:21.690
The number you have dialed is outside your calling area, or the phone might be switched off...

04:19.440 --> 04:20.940
DIALING

04:19.440 --> 04:20.940
Miyamura Miyako

04:24.030 --> 04:25.160
Sorry to have kept you waiting.

04:28.580 --> 04:30.160
So, what did the doctor say?

04:30.160 --> 04:34.660
Let's see... naisoku sokusoku... jintai sokusoku?

04:30.160 --> 04:38.590
She most likely means to say "naisoku sokufuku jintai sonshou", which means "Medical Collateral Ligament Injury".

04:34.660 --> 04:36.330
That's nothing but "soku".

04:36.330 --> 04:38.590
It kind of sounds like that.

04:38.590 --> 04:41.460
At least remember the name of your own injury.

04:41.460 --> 04:45.180
He told me to rest and not move it until it doesn't hurt anymore.

04:45.800 --> 04:48.930
Really? Then you can't play basketball for a while.

04:48.930 --> 04:49.510
Yeah.

04:53.350 --> 04:54.230
There.

04:54.930 --> 04:55.640
Thank you.

04:56.440 --> 04:58.770
How's your tendonitis?

04:58.770 --> 05:01.980
Same as usual. If I rest my arm, it will get better.

05:02.690 --> 05:05.780
Maybe I should slow down my pace.

05:06.030 --> 05:07.070
Eh?

05:07.070 --> 05:09.620
Since you have to rest your knee too.

05:10.030 --> 05:11.490
Should I keep you company for a while?

05:11.490 --> 05:12.450
Yes.

05:28.090 --> 05:31.350
"The girl began to look at the painting a lot."

05:31.930 --> 05:36.230
"When she stared at the boy in the painting, she had a strange feeling."

05:36.850 --> 05:40.520
"'Let's marry.' She somehow had that idea."

05:41.480 --> 05:45.780
"In the books, there were an unusual number of stories relating to marriage."

05:46.360 --> 05:50.280
"It was described as something important in people's lives."

05:50.950 --> 05:56.200
"She began to study the marriage system in detail."

05:57.960 --> 06:00.960
Renji-kun, have you decided about your career?

06:01.460 --> 06:04.340
You got a career interest survey, right?

06:04.340 --> 06:07.420
Yeah. It's hard to decide.

06:07.420 --> 06:10.390
You should become a novelist too.

06:11.010 --> 06:13.890
It's fun to write stories.

06:13.890 --> 06:15.930
I do yearn to become a novelist, but...

06:16.930 --> 06:18.600
It's impossible after all.

06:18.600 --> 06:20.190
Why?

06:20.190 --> 06:26.030
After reading what you wrote, I don't think I can catch up at all.

06:26.730 --> 06:28.780
I don't have the talent after all.

06:29.490 --> 06:31.860
That's not true. It's not like that.

06:32.870 --> 06:36.910
It has nothing to do with talent or anything. What's important is doing it.

06:36.910 --> 06:39.540
You taught me that.

06:40.540 --> 06:45.550
Thanks to you, I'm about to finish writing a story.

06:45.550 --> 06:48.800
Even though I thought I couldn't possibly do it.

06:49.550 --> 06:50.760
Chihiro...

06:50.760 --> 06:54.390
Even though my memory only lasts thirteen hours...

06:54.390 --> 06:57.640
Even though my life experiences haven't progressed since I was twelve...

06:57.640 --> 07:01.270
You taught me that there are things I could do.

07:02.060 --> 07:05.270
Therefore, please don't give up.

07:05.270 --> 07:08.570
If you have a dream, please don't give it up, and try your best.

07:10.860 --> 07:11.610
Yeah.

07:16.280 --> 07:17.910
It's still there.

07:22.120 --> 07:23.330
That's wrong.

07:23.330 --> 07:24.130
Eh?

07:24.580 --> 07:26.590
This here has to be more like this.

07:30.170 --> 07:32.180
Yeah, you're right.

07:36.890 --> 07:41.680
It's weird. What am I depressed about?

07:42.270 --> 07:44.440
Things are back to how they were.

07:45.020 --> 07:47.610
I can still go wherever I want freely.

07:48.780 --> 07:52.740
This is not a place you should come or return to.

07:55.280 --> 07:56.570
Leave me alone.

07:57.280 --> 08:01.370
Even if you trap yourself in the ruins of the past, nothing good will come of it.

08:03.870 --> 08:07.420
Where should I go?

08:07.420 --> 08:09.630
You know about warmth.

08:11.010 --> 08:15.930
As long as you remember the feeling of tenderness, you won't choose the wrong path.

08:16.840 --> 08:20.470
I don't have such a faraway memory.

08:20.470 --> 08:23.600
But don't you already remember it?

08:23.850 --> 08:26.270
It might have been better if we hadn't met.

08:26.900 --> 08:31.730
I wouldn't remember warmth then.

08:38.990 --> 08:41.040
Chihiro's condition has improved?

08:41.040 --> 08:45.290
Yeah. Even though it's little by little, her memory is better than before...

08:45.290 --> 08:46.620
That's impossible.

08:46.620 --> 08:47.330
But...

08:47.330 --> 08:49.880
It would be a different story if a miracle happened.

08:49.880 --> 08:53.340
But miracles don't exist in this world.

08:53.840 --> 08:58.760
There are only inevitabilities and accidents, and what someone has done.

08:58.760 --> 08:59.800
That's it.

09:01.310 --> 09:04.480
Do you remember what I told you?

09:05.230 --> 09:08.980
Forget about it. It may be too late already.

09:11.980 --> 09:15.780
The number you have dialed is outside your calling area...

09:16.900 --> 09:18.280
That Miyako.

09:20.120 --> 09:22.790
Hirono Hiro-kun of grade 2 class D,

09:22.790 --> 09:25.660
and Miyamura Miyako-san of grade 2 class A,

09:25.660 --> 09:28.710
please come to the career guidance room after school.

09:31.340 --> 09:33.000
What did they say, Onii-chan?

09:33.000 --> 09:36.260
They asked me what I planned to do with my career interest survey.

09:36.760 --> 09:38.550
Miyamura-senpai too?

09:38.550 --> 09:40.340
She skipped school.

09:40.340 --> 09:45.060
I see. Isn't studying better than working after all?

09:45.060 --> 09:48.440
Yeah. Maybe I should take this opportunity to rehabilitate too.

09:48.440 --> 09:53.150
Oh, yeah. Let's go somewhere and have fun after this deadline. I...

09:58.360 --> 10:00.360
Yes, this is Shindou Nagi.

10:00.780 --> 10:03.160
Oh. Well, I'll make it somehow.

10:03.700 --> 10:04.910
A one-shot?

10:09.000 --> 10:11.040
Okay. I'll give it a try.

10:11.040 --> 10:13.340
I'll send you a plot outline this week.

10:13.340 --> 10:15.050
Yeah, see you then.

10:15.840 --> 10:17.340
Is it about work?

10:17.340 --> 10:19.380
They asked me to draw a one-shot.

10:19.380 --> 10:21.470
Something other than the series.

10:21.470 --> 10:22.300
Are you going to do it?

10:22.300 --> 10:24.140
Yeah, it's an opportunity.

10:24.140 --> 10:26.850
No way. You said you were going to rest just now...

10:26.850 --> 10:29.230
If I decline, there won't be a next time.

10:29.480 --> 10:35.360
If a newcomer like me doesn't seize every chance that passes by, he won't succeed.

10:35.360 --> 10:38.240
Really? Then do whatever you like.

10:38.240 --> 10:39.320
Where are you going?

10:39.320 --> 10:42.160
Club activities. If I don't move, my body will become dull.

10:42.160 --> 10:44.740
You idiot. You were told to rest, weren't you?

10:44.740 --> 10:47.620
Same goes for you. You're not going to rest, even though your arm won't get better, are you?

10:47.620 --> 10:50.870
If you really damage your knee, you won't be able to play basketball anymore.

10:50.870 --> 10:54.250
Same goes for you. If you get really hurt, you won't be able to draw manga anymore.

10:54.250 --> 10:57.760
If I stop drawing, some other artist will seize the opportunity!

10:57.760 --> 11:00.010
Same goes for me. I have to fight to be a regular!

11:00.010 --> 11:02.640
Anyway, you won't be able to be a regular with that injury.

11:04.100 --> 11:05.810
Onii-chan, you idiot!

11:12.140 --> 11:13.400
She didn't really notice anything abnormal either after that.
She kept thinking about what that was while she washed the stained clothes.
Blood came out again about the time she forgot that incident.
She wondered why her body felt sluggish during the few days around that.

11:12.140 --> 11:13.400
And it stopped after a few days.

11:12.140 --> 11:13.400
Then it happened again.

11:12.140 --> 11:13.400
So...

11:12.140 --> 11:13.400
She learned that was menstruation.
It meant she had become an adult -- seemingly, she was ready to bear a child.
She was indeed a human girl after all.
However, even if she was ready for that, in a world without men...

11:14.810 --> 11:16.190
She didn't really notice anything abnormal either after that.
She kept thinking about what that was while she washed the stained clothes.
Blood came out again about the time she forgot that incident.
She wondered why her body felt sluggish during the few days around that.

11:14.810 --> 11:16.190
And it stopped after a few days.

11:14.810 --> 11:16.190
Then it happened again.

11:14.810 --> 11:16.190
So...

11:14.810 --> 11:16.190
She learned that was menstruation.
It meant she had become an adult -- seemingly, she was ready to bear a child.
She was indeed a human girl after all.
However, even if she was ready for that, in a world without men...

11:20.900 --> 11:22.570
Did I fall asleep just now?

11:23.200 --> 11:24.700
How many hours have passed?

11:25.070 --> 11:27.200
How long have I slept?

11:27.200 --> 11:30.870
Nah. Only around five minutes.

11:30.870 --> 11:32.870
I... see.

11:35.330 --> 11:36.920
Aren't you exhausted?

11:36.920 --> 11:39.760
Not at all. I'm not tired at all.

11:39.760 --> 11:42.050
Really? It's all right then.

11:42.050 --> 11:44.180
Yes, I'm all right.

11:44.550 --> 11:46.050
---- seemingly, she was ready

11:48.060 --> 11:49.810
He really is an idiot.

11:49.810 --> 11:52.770
He's taking on more work, even though he doesn't have enough days in attendance.

11:52.770 --> 11:54.230
What is he thinking?

11:54.230 --> 11:57.110
You can't demand planning from him.

11:57.650 --> 11:59.940
Why did you start playing basketball?

11:59.940 --> 12:01.990
I liked it from the beginning.

12:01.990 --> 12:07.240
It feels really good to attack swiftly, shake off your opponents, then shoot the ball.

12:07.240 --> 12:08.580
We're the same.

12:08.580 --> 12:09.080
Eh?

12:09.410 --> 12:15.460
The moment you capture a video that moves people's hearts from time and space gives you the best feeling there is.

12:15.460 --> 12:16.880
Hm...

12:16.880 --> 12:18.710
It's the same for Hirono.

12:20.000 --> 12:23.050
He's way ahead of us.

12:23.550 --> 12:26.760
That's why it's a lot harder for him than for us.

12:28.350 --> 12:30.140
But he's an idiot after all.

12:30.140 --> 12:32.600
You two are really clumsy.

12:32.600 --> 12:33.810
What do you mean?

12:33.810 --> 12:36.690
Hm... Nah, nothing.

12:36.690 --> 12:38.770
It's unfair not to finish your sentence.

12:38.770 --> 12:42.570
When you film the life of a wild animal,

12:42.570 --> 12:46.950
the film unit must not interfere with the behavior of that animal.

12:46.950 --> 12:50.410
You have to shoot wildlife just as it is.

12:50.410 --> 12:52.540
How does that relate to us?

12:52.540 --> 12:55.670
If I cut into the conversation between the two of you, I would be interfering.

12:56.500 --> 12:58.500
Don't compare people to animals!

12:59.670 --> 13:04.010
Geez. Please don't talk like you know everything.

13:04.800 --> 13:06.090
I do.

13:06.800 --> 13:09.800
If I look through the finder, I can see everything.

13:21.940 --> 13:23.440
'06 Film contest

14:06.650 --> 14:07.110
Hmm?

14:08.990 --> 14:11.240
Chihiro. Chihiro.

14:11.240 --> 14:11.910
What's wrong?

14:11.910 --> 14:14.450
Ah, I was just thinking about something.

14:14.450 --> 14:15.830
In the middle of the meal?

14:15.830 --> 14:17.000
I'm sorry.

14:20.080 --> 14:23.750
11:50. I arrived at the library.

14:23.750 --> 14:25.920
Renji-kun came four minutes later.

14:25.920 --> 14:27.840
We had lunch in the courtyard.

14:28.920 --> 14:34.260
The menu of the obento consisted of fried white fish, Japanese-style salad, and other things.

14:34.260 --> 14:37.430
Dessert was strawberry jelly. It was delicious.

14:37.430 --> 14:40.900
I always look forward to Renji-kun's obento.

14:40.900 --> 14:43.020
"How many points does it get today?"

14:43.020 --> 14:46.530
"It's so delicious that it can't be scored with points."

14:48.030 --> 14:51.360
"Please teach me how to cook next time."

14:51.360 --> 14:54.780
"Well, let's try something simple then."

15:00.790 --> 15:02.370
It's only three o'clock.

15:05.380 --> 15:09.170
It's okay. I can still remember.

15:13.550 --> 15:14.850
What are you doing?

15:15.890 --> 15:18.140
You're still sorting your memories this late?

15:18.430 --> 15:21.600
Before going to sleep, didn't you read over the necessary parts again?

15:21.600 --> 15:23.900
Yes, just the summaries.

15:23.900 --> 15:24.770
Summaries?

15:24.770 --> 15:28.070
I only wrote summaries into the diary.

15:28.070 --> 15:31.820
I wrote the fun moments as fun moments.

15:31.820 --> 15:39.500
However, why they were fun, and how I felt, I couldn't write any of that down.

15:39.500 --> 15:41.620
That's why you're thinking back about it?

15:41.620 --> 15:45.170
If I skim through this, I'll be able to remember in detail.

15:45.170 --> 15:49.260
In that case, I'll be able to remember things for longer than thirteen hours from now on.

15:49.760 --> 15:54.760
By the time I meet Renji-kun at noon, I'll be able to remember everything until now.

15:51.630 --> 15:54.760
Year

15:51.630 --> 15:54.760
Month

15:51.630 --> 15:54.760
Day

15:51.630 --> 15:54.760
Day of Week

15:54.760 --> 15:57.430
It will take you till morning to do that.

15:57.430 --> 15:58.100
Yes.

15:58.100 --> 15:59.430
Can you keep up with that?

15:59.430 --> 16:02.640
It's because I don't want to lose my time with Renji-kun.

16:03.560 --> 16:06.440
I'm just a normal girl too.

16:07.940 --> 16:09.440
Is it okay now?

16:09.440 --> 16:11.070
I don't have much time left.

16:13.900 --> 16:15.450
What are you doing?

16:15.450 --> 16:17.030
It's useless, even if you do something like that.

16:17.030 --> 16:18.490
It's not useless.

16:18.490 --> 16:19.990
There's no way you can keep doing it.

16:19.990 --> 16:21.040
Don't force yourself.

16:21.040 --> 16:22.580
I'm not forcing myself.

16:22.580 --> 16:25.170
Listen to me. It's bad for you.

16:25.170 --> 16:29.460
Please give it back to me. Give it back. I beg you, please give it back to me!

16:29.460 --> 16:33.590
Inside that... Inside that is my Renji-kun!

16:39.390 --> 16:41.060
I won't forget this.

16:42.060 --> 16:44.810
I'll never forget about this!

16:47.190 --> 16:48.230
I understand.

16:49.650 --> 16:51.780
I'm sorry for saying something selfish.

16:57.530 --> 16:58.620
Don't overdo it.

17:05.370 --> 17:08.080
How was it when we first met?

17:08.580 --> 17:12.760
I want to retain the important past in my heart one more time.

17:12.760 --> 17:13.960
Chihiro...

17:15.800 --> 17:17.430
You were looking at the sky.

17:17.840 --> 17:22.430
You kept gazing at the sky. It gave me a strange feeling somehow.

17:22.430 --> 17:23.890
Sky, eh?

17:24.390 --> 17:28.350
I think I was indeed looking at the sky at that time.

17:29.270 --> 17:33.650
But now it's more fun to look in front of me than at the sky.

17:38.570 --> 17:39.530
Erm...

17:40.870 --> 17:41.580
What is it?

17:43.830 --> 17:45.790
Renji-kun and I...

17:46.460 --> 17:50.040
Erm, if it's okay with you...

17:51.500 --> 17:54.300
Can we hold hands?

17:56.630 --> 17:58.340
It's fine if we can't.

17:58.340 --> 18:01.300
I don't really want to force you.

18:01.300 --> 18:04.600
I was just thinking of trying to hold hands for a bit.

18:06.350 --> 18:09.230
Can... we?

18:11.610 --> 18:12.230
Sure.

18:15.150 --> 18:15.860
Let's hold hands.

18:15.860 --> 18:16.740
Okay.

18:31.130 --> 18:32.670
Chihiro! What's wrong?

18:32.670 --> 18:35.880
Chihiro! Chihiro! Chihiro!

18:37.380 --> 18:40.840
"The girl married on the next day."

18:40.840 --> 18:43.890
"She found a dress in the castle."

18:44.350 --> 18:50.140
"She pretended to ask herself, 'Do you vow to marry?' in her mind, and she pretended to answer 'Yes'."

18:50.140 --> 18:54.650
"And then she kissed the boy in the painting."

18:54.650 --> 18:56.400
"It tasted like oil."

18:57.030 --> 19:00.860
"She threw the flowers that she picked as a bouquet."

19:01.320 --> 19:03.780
"She prepared a bigger meal than usual."

19:04.200 --> 19:05.950
"It was a party after all."

19:06.450 --> 19:11.540
"But she had leftovers, because the dress was too tight around the hips."

19:12.370 --> 19:19.590
"The girl tossed the bouquet, the dress, and the leftovers to the bottom of the dump site and went to sleep."

19:19.590 --> 19:21.930
"And thus the wedding ceremony was over."

19:26.600 --> 19:27.810
It's you, eh.

19:28.390 --> 19:29.600
Erm...

19:29.600 --> 19:30.100
Come in.

19:30.930 --> 19:32.270
You heard me, didn't you?

19:32.270 --> 19:33.060
Come in.

19:35.230 --> 19:37.190
Is Chihiro all right?

19:37.190 --> 19:41.740
Strain and lack of sleep, plus mental stress.

19:41.740 --> 19:46.450
She kept straining herself, so she broke down once she felt relieved.

19:48.040 --> 19:50.830
I tried to wake her up several times, but it didn't work.

19:51.210 --> 19:54.790
She passed her time limit already, so just let her sleep quietly for now.

19:54.790 --> 19:56.500
Time limit?

19:58.300 --> 19:59.300
Chihiro.

20:04.430 --> 20:06.680
Onii-san, who are you?

20:08.810 --> 20:11.310
Eh? Why am I...

20:12.140 --> 20:14.650
Eh? Eh?

20:17.110 --> 20:20.780
Why? Why have I grown up?

20:21.150 --> 20:23.030
What happened to my eye?

20:23.030 --> 20:24.030
Chihiro...

20:24.030 --> 20:26.910
Where's Onee-chan? Where's Kei-oneechan?

20:26.910 --> 20:30.200
Where's Hiro-oniichan? What happened to me?

20:28.950 --> 20:30.200
Calm down, Chihiro.

20:30.200 --> 20:31.660
You already...

20:31.660 --> 20:33.910
Why? Why?

20:33.910 --> 20:35.420
What happened to me?

20:36.750 --> 20:37.330
Wait!

20:39.590 --> 20:41.590
No!

20:48.680 --> 20:51.350
Chihiro, do you recognize me?

20:54.310 --> 20:56.810
Himura... oniichan?

20:57.860 --> 20:59.820
You still remember me, don't you?

21:04.240 --> 21:06.740
Now you understand, right? This is Chihiro.

21:08.240 --> 21:13.250
This girl is stuck at twelve years and thirteen hours.

21:13.750 --> 21:15.250
Forever.

21:27.380 --> 21:34.680
yumemiteta hitori

21:27.380 --> 21:34.680
I dreamed of being alone

21:35.890 --> 21:46.200
sora miage itsuka mabushii ta

21:35.890 --> 21:46.200
Looking up at the sky which once had dazzled me

21:46.490 --> 21:54.950
itami wo omoidasu no

21:46.490 --> 21:54.950
I remember my pain

21:55.040 --> 22:06.510
shiroi hane ni kaze wo fuke

21:55.040 --> 22:06.510
Blow wind, to the white feathers

22:06.800 --> 22:18.190
yureru kioku ni kagi wo toke

22:06.800 --> 22:18.190
Unlock the key to my wavering memories

22:18.310 --> 22:29.490
todoke hate made douka kanata he

22:18.310 --> 22:29.490
Please reach the other side, even if it means the very end

22:29.820 --> 22:38.370
egao anata ni modoru

22:29.820 --> 22:38.370
I will return the smile to your face

22:38.660 --> 22:41.210
ashita he

22:38.660 --> 22:41.210
Towards tomorrow

22:52.470 --> 22:53.970
Incoming Call

22:52.470 --> 22:53.970
PUBLIC TELEPHONE

22:54.720 --> 22:56.100
Yes, this is Hirono.

22:57.520 --> 22:58.390
Hello?

23:01.770 --> 23:03.520
Hello, can you hear me?

23:06.320 --> 23:07.360
Is this Miyako?

23:08.110 --> 23:09.240
Bingo.

23:09.240 --> 23:10.280
Miyako...

23:10.650 --> 23:14.120
What, so you do remember me.

23:14.120 --> 23:17.740
What's wrong? I was worried because I couldn't get in touch with you.

23:17.740 --> 23:19.790
Turn on your phone!

23:20.160 --> 23:21.920
So I didn't disappear.

23:23.210 --> 23:26.880
I still haven't disappeared yet.

23:28.090 --> 23:31.800
If you don't know about pain, you will face a more painful tragedy.

23:32.470 --> 23:35.600
Next episode, ef - a tale of memories:

23:35.970 --> 23:37.310
Forget me not.

23:38.180 --> 23:40.850
Do you have memories you don't want to forget?
